<title>TURKEY: Turkish wholesale prices up 3.8 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Turkish wholesale prices up 3.8 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's wholesale prices rose 3.8 percent in August, up from 2.4 percent in July, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said consumer prices were up by 4.8 percent in August, up from 2.1 percent in July.  </p>
<p>Year-on-year wholesale prices went up by 79 percent in August, up from 76.3 percent a month ago. The year-on-year consumer price rise was 81.9 percent, up slightly from 81.2 percent in July.</p>
<p> TURKISH PRICES		 Aug 96   July 96    Aug 95  Dec 95</p>
<p>Consumer mo/mo pct change     4.8	2.1	  4.3     3.8</p>
<p>Consumer yr/yr		   81.9     81.2	 83.3    76.0</p>
<p>Consumer index (1994=100)   350.4    334.5	192.6   239.6</p>
<p>Wholesale mo/mo		   3.8	2.4	  2.3     4.3</p>
<p>Wholesale yr/yr		  79.0     76.3	 76.2    65.6</p>
<p>Wholesale index (1994=100)  340.6    328.2	190.3   223.1</p>
</text>
